---
description: "Step-by-step guide for implementing a new feature in this codebase"
alwaysApply: false
---

## Checklist
1. Types → `src/types.ts`
2. Model function → `src/models/task.model.ts`
3. Service function → `src/services/task.service.ts`
4. Controller handler → `src/controllers/task.controller.ts`
5. Route → `src/routes/task.routes.ts`
6. Validation helpers → `src/validation.ts` if needed
7. Unit test → `tests/unit/`
8. Integration test → `tests/integration/`
9. `npm test` — all must pass

## Constraints
- Controllers never call models directly
- Validate in the controller, business logic in the service
- All existing tests must still pass
